stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> FieldAvailable
    FieldAvailable --> TechniqueCharge: learned technique pressed while eligible
    TechniqueCharge --> NormalCast: release before charge threshold
    TechniqueCharge --> ChargedCast: release after charge threshold
    TechniqueCharge --> FieldAvailable: cancellation or interruption
    NormalCast --> FieldAvailable: cast completes
    ChargedCast --> FieldAvailable: cast completes
    FieldAvailable --> MenuOverlay: open menu
    TechniqueCharge --> MenuOverlay: open menu / cancel charge
    MenuOverlay --> FieldAvailable: close menu / no buffered action
    FieldAvailable --> Cutscene: scripted entry
    Cutscene --> FieldAvailable: scripted exit
    FieldAvailable --> EquipmentChange: accepted equipment change
    EquipmentChange --> FieldAvailable: validate profile / clear transient state
    FieldAvailable --> SceneTransition: area change or city return
    SceneTransition --> FieldAvailable: new scene / reset transient state
    note right of MenuOverlay
        Overlay is not a replacement locomotion state.
        Preserve existing movement and pause policy.
        Menu and cooldown interactions need rollout testing.
    end note
    note right of EquipmentChange
        Planned shared-system contract.
        Never carry old weapon queue, guard or release timers.
        Missing mappings require an explicit fallback.
    end note
